# Pull coord feeds from podium (the production ingestion host) so appendix
# dev/SDLC consumers (the coord smoke gate, lane checkouts of hapax-coord) see
# fresh feeds. One-directional pull; appendix never writes back.
# Born 2026-06-12: cx-gold UX-2 smoke run blocked on missing sdlc-vocab.json
# (REQ-20260612-exec-host-provisioning-contract).
#
# ALLOWLIST (since 2026-09-25, row
# coord-ledger-appendix-mirror-destroys-local-appends-20260925). The payload is
# the FEED plane ONLY: sdlc-vocab.json, review-receipts.json, sdlc-events.jsonl,
# sdlc-events.shadow.json. Everything else under coord/ is never mirrored:
#
# - ledger.db / ledger.db-wal / ledger.db-shm / ledger.jsonl / spool/ are the
#   coordination EVENT LOG. A timestamp-preserving rsync replace of a WAL ledger
#   silently discards every local canonical commit and leaves the local writer
#   failing "disk I/O error" indefinitely while integrity_check reports ok
#   (relay/inflections/20260810-coord-mirror-destroys-the-ledger-it-mirrors.md,
#   measured: frame/append-only-logs-20260925 E2 §3). This exclude-list shape
#   is why 70 methodology-dispatch intents of 2026-09-23/24 never landed.
#   appendix's ledger.db is a downstream replica; appendix coord writers spool
#   for the canonical writer on podium (shared/coord_event_log.py docstring).
# - grants/ and grant-key are the ESCAPE-AUTHORIZATION plane (2026-08-04
#   incident): a grant minted on podium must not become valid on appendix by
#   riding a feed mirror. Each host mints its own.
#
# Pinned by tests/systemd/test_coord_feed_mirror_unit.py, including a real
# rsync run that must leave a live local WAL untouched.
[Unit]
Description=Pull coord feeds from podium (dev-host mirror)
Wants=network-online.target
OnFailure=notify-failure@%n.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/rsync -a --timeout=10 \
          --include=sdlc-vocab.json --include=review-receipts.json \
          --include=sdlc-events.jsonl --include=sdlc-events.shadow.json \
          --exclude='*' \
          hapax-podium:.cache/hapax/coord/  %h/.cache/hapax/coord/
